id: JUDGE8-5
package: fandhe-workshop-pack
test: text_fill
target: crates/core/src/text_fill.rs
find:         step_do: step_do_at(step, run.guidance_level).map(str::to_string),
replace:         step_do: step_do_at(step, run.guidance_level).map(str::to_string).or_else(|| Some(step.title.clone())),
expect-fail: judge8_step_do_is_not_replaced_by_title
note: do の無い Step で step_do に題名を代わりに入れる（静的な数え上げとの食い違い）
